## Performance Testing

### Load Testing
- Test with high-frequency price updates
- Validate concurrent triangle checking
- Monitor memory usage and goroutine leaks
- Test WebSocket connection stability

### Benchmark Testing
```go
func BenchmarkCheckArbitrage(b *testing.B) {
    triangle := createTestTriangle()
    orderbook := createMockOrderBook()
    
    b.ResetTimer()
    for i := 0; i < b.N; i++ {
        triangle.CheckArbitrage(orderbook, 0.001)
    }
}
```

